export class Utils{static validateEmail(t){return/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(t)}static validatePassword(t){const r=/[A-Z]/.test(t),n=/[a-z]/.test(t),s=/\d/.test(t);return t.length>=8&&r&&n&&s}static validatePhone(t){return/^(\+90|0)?[5][0-9]{2}[0-9]{7}$/.test(t.replace(/\s/g,""))}static formatPrice(t,e="TRY"){return new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR",{style:"currency",currency:e}).format(t)}static formatNumber(t){return new Intl.NumberFormat("tr-TR").format(t)}static formatDate(t,e={}){const r={year:"numeric",month:"long",day:"numeric"};return new Date(t).toLocaleDateString("tr-TR",{...r,...e})}static formatRelativeTime(t){const r=new Date-new Date(t),n=Math.floor(r/6e4),s=Math.floor(r/36e5),o=Math.floor(r/864e5);return n<1?"\u015Eimdi":n<60?`${n} dakika \xF6nce`:s<24?`${s} saat \xF6nce`:o<7?`${o} g\xFCn \xF6nce`:o<30?`${Math.floor(o/7)} hafta \xF6nce`:this.formatDate(t,{year:"numeric",month:"short",day:"numeric"})}static slugify(t){return t.toString().toLowerCase().trim().replace(/\s+/g,"-").replace(/[^\w-]+/g,"").replace(/--+/g,"-").replace(/^-+/,"").replace(/-+$/,"")}static capitalize(t){return t.charAt(0).toUpperCase()+t.slice(1).toLowerCase()}static truncate(t,e=100,r="..."){return t.length<=e?t:t.substring(0,e-r.length)+r}static unique(t){return[...new Set(t)]}static shuffle(t){const e=[...t];for(let r=e.length-1;r>0;r--){const n=Math.floor(Math.random()*(r+1));[e[r],e[n]]=[e[n],e[r]]}return e}static chunk(t,e){const r=[];for(let n=0;n<t.length;n+=e)r.push(t.slice(n,n+e));return r}static deepClone(t){return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(t))}static isEmpty(t){return t==null||Object.keys(t).length===0}static pick(t,e){return e.reduce((r,n)=>(n in t&&(r[n]=t[n]),r),{})}static createElement(t,e={},r=[]){const n=document.createElement(t);return Object.entries(e).forEach(([s,o])=>{s==="className"?n.className=o:s==="textContent"?n.textContent=o:s==="innerHTML"?n.innerHTML=o:s.startsWith("on")&&typeof o=="function"?n.addEventListener(s.substring(2).toLowerCase(),o):n.setAttribute(s,o)}),r.forEach(s=>{typeof s=="string"?n.appendChild(document.createTextNode(s)):n.appendChild(s)}),n}static querySelectorAll(t,e=document){return Array.from(e.querySelectorAll(t))}static addClass(t,e){t.classList.add(e)}static removeClass(t,e){t.classList.remove(e)}static toggleClass(t,e){t.classList.toggle(e)}static hasClass(t,e){return t.classList.contains(e)}static debounce(t,e){let r;return function(...s){const o=()=>{clearTimeout(r),t(...s)};clearTimeout(r),r=setTimeout(o,e)}}static throttle(t,e){let r;return function(){const n=arguments,s=this;r||(t.apply(s,n),r=!0,setTimeout(()=>r=!1,e))}}static setLocalStorage(t,e){try{localStorage.setItem(t,JSON.stringify(e))}catch(r){console.error("Failed to save to localStorage:",r)}}static getLocalStorage(t,e=null){try{const r=localStorage.getItem(t);return r?JSON.parse(r):e}catch(r){return console.error("Failed to read from localStorage:",r),e}}static removeLocalStorage(t){try{localStorage.removeItem(t)}catch(e){console.error("Failed to remove from localStorage:",e)}}static getQueryParams(){const t={},r=window.location.search.substring(1).split("&");for(let n=0;n<r.length;n++){const s=r[n].split("=");s[0]&&(t[decodeURIComponent(s[0])]=decodeURIComponent(s[1]||""))}return t}static buildQueryString(t){const e=Object.entries(t).filter(([r,n])=>n!=null).map(([r,n])=>`${encodeURIComponent(r)}=${encodeURIComponent(n)}`);return e.length?`?${e.join("&")}`:""}static formatFileSize(t){if(t===0)return"0 Bytes";const e=1024,r=["Bytes","KB","MB","GB"],n=Math.floor(Math.log(t)/Math.log(e));return parseFloat((t/Math.pow(e,n)).toFixed(2))+" "+r[n]}static getFileExtension(t){return t.split(".").pop().toLowerCase()}static isImageFile(t){return["jpg","jpeg","png","gif","webp","svg"].includes(this.getFileExtension(t))}static sleep(t){return new Promise(e=>setTimeout(e,t))}static timeout(t,e){return Promise.race([t,new Promise((r,n)=>setTimeout(()=>n(new Error("Operation timed out")),e))])}static generateId(t=8){const e="ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789";let r="";for(let n=0;n<t;n++)r+=e.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random()*e.length));return r}static randomInt(t,e){return Math.floor(Math.random()*(e-t+1))+t}static formatTurkishPhone(t){const r=t.replace(/\D/g,"").match(/^(\d{1})(\d{3})(\d{3})(\d{2})(\d{2})$/);return r?`+90 ${r[2]} ${r[3]} ${r[4]} ${r[5]}`:t}static formatTurkishId(t){const e=t.replace(/\D/g,"");return e.length===11?`${e.slice(0,3)}.${e.slice(3,6)}.${e.slice(6,9)}-${e.slice(9)}`:t}}export default Utils;
